{"id":507,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"6年間で挑戦を育てる宗像の中高一貫","feature_description":"宗像高等学校は、6年間を通した一貫教育の中で、学習と部活動の両立を支える学校です。教育方針では、6年間の教育内容を整理し、中高の円滑な接続を図ることが示され、学校生活では20以上の部活動・同好会が活発に活動しています。仲間と高め合いながら、学校代表として挑戦できる環境が整っています。学びの幅と学校生活の厚みを感じやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":9983,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9984,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9985,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9986,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9987,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9988,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9989,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9990,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9991,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9992,"name":"総合部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9993,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95-2/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9994,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://munakata.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5